# Build context for services/scorer/Dockerfile (BuildKit reads <Dockerfile>.dockerignore): everything is excluded
# except what the image copies, so the repo's data, clones and models never reach the build.
*
!services/scorer/requirements.txt
!services/scorer/scorer/
!pipelines/training/outcome_features.py
!contracts/pr_features.schema.json
!contracts/mined_dataset.schema.json
!contracts/score_result.schema.json
!contracts/score_log.schema.json
**/__pycache__/
